oneconnect-gui for Debian/Ubuntu
===============================

Autostart policy
----------------

This package does not force GUI autostart globally for all users.

An example autostart desktop file is installed at:

  /usr/share/doc/oneconnect-gui/examples/oneconnect-gui-autostart.desktop

Users can enable autostart per account with:

  mkdir -p ~/.config/autostart
  cp /usr/share/doc/oneconnect-gui/examples/oneconnect-gui-autostart.desktop \
     ~/.config/autostart/oneconnect-gui.desktop

If oneconnect-gui is not on PATH for your session, edit Exec= to an absolute path.

GNOME tray support
------------------

For GNOME-based desktops, install/enable AppIndicator support:

  sudo apt install gnome-shell-extension-appindicator

Then enable "AppIndicator and KStatusNotifierItem Support" in the Extensions app.
